{
  "slug": "rubixkube",
  "name": "Rubixkube",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Site Reliability Intelligence for modern infrastructure. Investigate incidents, review evidence-backed root cause analyses, and track remediation across Kubernetes, AWS, GCP, Linux VMs, and hybrid platforms.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `active-issues` (List open infrastructure issues prioritized by severity), `cluster-health` (Complete health view of a specific RubixKube environment: infrastructure details, resource status, workload counts, active issues, and recent…), `infra-status` (RubixKube platform overview and recent activity timeline), `investigate` (Deep investigation of a specific infrastructure issue), `pending-actions` (List open remediation action items with priority and linked incident context), `rca-report` (Full root cause analysis report for a specific incident)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `rubixkube`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install rubixkube@claude-community` from `rubixkube-io/rubixkube-for-ai`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
